            </note>
            <note corresp="#d168-f2" n="1" xml:id="d168-f2-content">
                <p><ref target="#d167">Document 167</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d168-f3" n="2" xml:id="d168-f3-content">
                <p>In a memorandum to all staff who attended the White House staff meetings, May 17,
                    Bromley Smith wrote that McGeorge Bundy proposed to discuss Bell’s May 13
                    memorandum to the President at a staff meeting the following week. (Kennedy
                    Library, National Security Files, Meetings and Memoranda Series, NSAM No. 159)
                    No record of a White House staff meeting discussing Bell’s memorandum has been
                    found.</p>
            </note>
